beellama.cpp - https://github.com/Anbeeld/beellama.cpp

The KVarN KV-cache quantizer (kvarn_quantize / kvarn_dequant), the composite
Walsh-Hadamard rotation (kvarn_rotate) and the record layout read by the
sdpa_decode_gqa_kvarn / sdpa_fa_verify_kvarn kernels are ported to Metal
from beellama.cpp's kvarn implementation (ggml/src/ggml-cuda/kvarn.cu and
its CPU backend). The parity fixtures under tests/fixtures/kvarn are
generated by compiling its CPU functions. The method is Huawei's KVarN
(arXiv:2606.03458). beellama.cpp is a fork of llama.cpp distributed under
the MIT License:

